sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CR as Scheduler/Cron
    participant M as ProviderKeyMonitor (Job)
    participant TM as Key Metadata Registry
    participant PS as Provider Sync Service
    participant V as Secrets Store (Vault/KMS)
    participant AR as Alerts Repository
    participant N as Notification Service
    participant EB as Event Bus

    Note over CR,M: Periodic scan for soon-to-expire or expired provider keys

    CR->>M: triggerScan()

    par refresh stale provider metadata
        M->>PS: refreshMetadataIfStale()
        PS-->>M: refreshed={true|false}
    and list candidate keys
        M->>TM: listKeyRefs(filter=active|expiringSoon|expired)
        TM-->>M: keyRefs[]
    end

    loop for each keyRef in keyRefs
        M->>TM: getKeyMetadata(keyRefId)
        TM-->>M: {provider, orgId, teamId, createdAt, lastRotatedAt, expiresAt, status}

        Note over M: compute ttl = expiresAt - now\nalertLevel = {info|warning|critical}

        alt status == revoked or deleted
            Note over M: skip alert creation
        else status in [active, expiring, expired]
            opt fetch key tail if policy requires
                M->>V: readKeyTail(keyRefId)
                V-->>M: ****...1234
            end

            M->>AR: upsertAlert(orgId, teamId, keyRefId, provider, expiresAt, alertLevel, keyTail)
            AR-->>M: {alertId, created|updated}

            M->>EB: publish(event=providerKey.expiryAlert, payload={alertId, orgId, teamId, keyRefId, alertLevel})
        end
    end

    par notify channels
        M->>N: notifyEmail(alertsBatch)
        N-->>M: emailResult
    and
        M->>N: notifySlack(alertsBatch)
        N-->>M: slackResult
    and
        M->>N: notifyWebhook(alertsBatch)
        N-->>M: webhookResult
    end

    Note over M: record job metrics: scanned, alerted, skipped, failures, duration
